<===> non_normalized/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@include meta.load-css("other", $with: ("\\24": override));

<===> non_normalized/_other.scss
$\$: original !default;
a {b: $\$}

<===> non_normalized/error
Error: $\24 was not declared with !default in the @used module.
  ,
2 | @include meta.load-css("other", $with: ("\\24": override));
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:1  root stylesheet

